HammerDB-derived PostgreSQL and MySQL TPROC-C workload

This workload includes SQL copied from HammerDB v6.1 and Go translations of
its PostgreSQL/MySQL clients, data-generation, and shared TPROC-C routines.

Upstream: https://github.com/TPC-Council/HammerDB
Release: v6.1
Commit: 2442b32756a484de4206bb0061d9bb28869beaf0
Upstream credits: Steve Shaw and the HammerDB contributors.
Source files: src/postgresql/pgoltp.tcl, src/mysql/mysqloltp.tcl, src/generic/gentpcc.tcl,
              modules/tpcccommon-1.0.tm.

