The separately maintained Stroppy SDK retains its own Apache-2.0 license.

The original SQL routines are preserved, including upstream quirks. Client and
loader code is translated to Go and uses the Stroppy SDK. Host provisioning,
Tcl GUI/CLI code, remote worker orchestration, and extension-specific dialects
are not included.
